# octabam-inserts page-2 walk + per-effect choosers.
# OCTABAM89_shots bank 3: T1 SPECTRUM, T2 CHARACTER, T3 MODULATION,
# T4 TRANSIENT, T5 EUCLID (FX1); T6 LOFI2, T7 GATE VERB, T8 DELAY (FX2).
# Measured 16 Oct: the boot restores the FX1 setup on PAGE 2 (the routing
# grid); NO steps to page 1; track keys switch tracks on page 1.
# Page-2 walk first (FX1 page 2 on T1-T5, then FX2 page 2 on T6-T8).
key 0x10
shot raw2/ins2-t1-p2
key 0x11
shot raw2/ins2-t2-p2
key 0x12
shot raw2/ins2-t3-p2
key 0x13
shot raw2/ins2-t4-p2
key 0x14
shot raw2/ins2-t5-p2
key 0x26
shot raw2/ins2-t5-fx2p2
key 0x15
shot raw2/ins2-t6-p2
key 0x16
shot raw2/ins2-t7-p2
key 0x17
shot raw2/ins2-t8-p2
# NO to page 1 (measured), then the per-effect choosers: FUNC+FX1 on the
# five FX1 tracks, FUNC+FX2 on the three FX2 tracks; NO closes the
# chooser to the main page (measured).
key 0x32
key 0x10
chord 0x2d 0x25
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t1
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x11
chord 0x2d 0x25
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t2
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x12
chord 0x2d 0x25
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t3
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x13
chord 0x2d 0x25
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t4
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x14
chord 0x2d 0x25
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t5
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x15
chord 0x2d 0x26
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t6
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x16
chord 0x2d 0x26
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t7
key 0x32
wait 0.5
key 0x17
chord 0x2d 0x26
wait 0.5
shot raw2/ins2-ch-t8
quit
